** {{hmp|en|Ben}}
** {{rhymes|en|ɛn|s=1}}
* {{hyph|en|been}}

====Verb====
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{inflection of|en|be||past|part}}.
#: {{ux|en|All the fries have '''been''' eaten.}}
#: {{ux|en|The milkman has '''been'''. He wanted to be paid.}}
